  "_comment": "Field resolution map (D6): how to obtain/validate each field. Generated once from registry metadata (system-owned -> fetch/derive, producer always/conditional -> ask_producer, bind_only -> defer) then hand-edited with playbook overrides. Steps run in order until a value is obtained. Actions: fetch{tool}, lookup{tool,default}, derive{from,table}, assume{value,when?}, ask_producer, defer_to_bind, post_bind_only. Judgement calls: sim-harness/protocols/JUDGEMENT_CALLS.md (R-*).",
